WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.880
Is Donald Trump lying about having been tested
for Corona virus and testing negative?

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:11.169
Now, I'm not suggesting Trump didn't test
negative, although it wouldn't surprise me

00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:15.339
that if Trump had tested positive, they simply
wouldn't tell us.

00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:20.039
But the timing, and especially Donald Trump's
very weird answer yesterday when he was asked

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:22.170
about what it was like to be tested.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.019
It all sounds very strange.

00:00:24.019 --> 00:00:26.689
And I don't know that Donald Trump was actually
tested.

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:27.789
So let's go through it.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:31.670
First, starting with the question yesterday
during Trump's coronavirus press conference,

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:37.390
Trump's first answer about the timing and
results of his test rotavirus.

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.620
Friday night, the White House doctor's office
put out a statement around midnight Friday

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.170
saying that no test was indicated.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:45.300
So when exactly was your test administered?

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.300
I had my test.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.780
I was late Friday night.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.260
And the reason I did it was because the I
had no symptoms whatsoever.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.859
So the doctor said, you have no symptoms.

00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:55.519
So we don't see any reason.

00:00:55.519 --> 00:00:58.850
But when I did the press conference on Friday,
everybody was going crazy.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:00:59.850
Did you do the test?

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:00.970
Did you do the tests?

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:04.610
So very late on Friday night, I did the tests.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:08.630
And he may have put out or the doctor may
put out something that I don't know what time

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:09.630
the letter went out.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.850
Maybe it was put up by somebody else.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.909
But the results came back, I believe.

00:01:12.909 --> 00:01:17.140
The following day and we tested negative.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:22.619
Question How could the White House doctors
offices indicate implying that you haven't

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:23.750
had one when in fact you had?

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.370
Well, I told them that and I went totally
by what they said.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.270
The doctors more than one.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.399
They said you don't have any of the symptoms.

00:01:31.399 --> 00:01:33.149
They checked what you're supposed to check.

00:01:33.149 --> 00:01:35.200
And that I didn't have symptoms, but I did
it.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:42.240
I did a test late on Friday night and it came
back probably 24 hours later or something.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.990
They sent it to the labs, came back.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:49.799
So understand the timeline that Trump is suggesting
here, combined with what we know Friday at

00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:51.189
3:30.

00:01:51.189 --> 00:01:54.090
Trump was asked during his press conference
about being tested and he said, I have no

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.090
symptoms.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.090
I don't need to be tested.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:59.079
But maybe someday I will be Friday evening.

00:01:59.079 --> 00:02:01.880
The White House said Trump doesn't need to
be tested.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:07.369
But then Trump now claims that late on Friday,
he was tested for Corona virus.

00:02:07.369 --> 00:02:10.290
If the White House puts out a statement saying
nobody worry.

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.530
Trump doesn't even need testing.

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.910
Why would he have been tested basically at
the exact same time that the White House was

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.430
putting out that statement?

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:23.220
And then Trump claims that Saturday evening,
so fewer than 24 hours from when he was supposedly

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:26.360
tested, he got a negative test result for
a corona virus.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.140
So the question is a good one.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.220
If at 3:00 p.m., you said no symptoms, no
need for a test.

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:35.330
If at night a doctor said no symptoms, no
need for a test.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.360
Why were you immediately tested?

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:42.420
And then there's also the question of tests
are taking longer than 20 hours or 18 hours.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.540
Now, of course, maybe when it's the president,
they fast track it.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.570
We don't know.

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:52.800
But they said that they are hopeful some day
we will get to 24 hour turnaround on tests.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.140
We're not there yet at this point in time.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.850
If the test was done very late Friday, as
Trump says.

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:03.240
And then early on Saturday evening, the results
were already announced.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.930
That is way less than the 48 to 72 hour range.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.530
That is typically the one that's also weird.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.950
But then we get to the real whopper.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.650
And this is this is what from me suggested
this guy's not been tested.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.400
Trump was asked about the test.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:21.420
And the test requires a swab to be inserted
pretty deeply into the nose to get to the

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.730
throat.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:23.730
It's not comfortable.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:28.800
Most people gag tier up, cough, et cetera,
which is why the people doing the tests have

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.230
to be in for medical protective gear.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:37.070
And Trump responds in a way where it doesn't
seem like he knows how the test is done.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:43.620
And so he says something very vague to avoid
saying something that is known to be untrue

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.710
about the test itself.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:48.230
Check it out and let me know what you think.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:52.430
That's not something I want to do every day.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:58.840
I can tell you that it's you know, it's a
little bit of a it's a little bit of good

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.120
doctors in the White House.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.610
But to test to test, it's a medical test.

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.090
Nothing pleasant about.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.090
It's a test.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.120
It's a medical test.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.760
And I wouldn't recommend.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.760
It's not something I would want to do again.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.780
Does this sound to anybody else like a completely
fabricated story that he made up completely

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:15.780
on the spot?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:16.780
So let me know what you think.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:19.100
Do you think Trump is lying about having been
tested at all?

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:21.250
Do you think Trump is lying about the negative
result?

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:25.680
If you said to me, is the lie about the result
or is the lie about being tested?

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:30.850
I think the lies about being tested not not
not about the result, although I do think

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.630
they would likely lie about the result as
well.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.630
Let me know what you think.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:05:53.530
I don't know.

